law.text:
		A security interest arising under §§ 8.2-401, 8.2-505, 8.2-711 (3), or § 8.2A-508 (5) is subject to this title. However, until the debtor obtains possession of the goods:

the security interest is enforceable, even if subdivision (b) (3) of § 8.9A-203 has not been satisfied;


filing is not required to perfect the security interest;


the rights of the secured party after default by the debtor are governed by Title 8.2 or Title 8.2A; and


the security interest has priority over a conflicting security interest created by the debtor.
